[0m[49m[39m  35,  39[0m:[39m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Every row runs the `harness` example twice as a subprocess — once per `.so` —
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m with an identical op script, and compares raw stdout bytes, exit code and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m terminating signal. Both libraries are loaded with `libloading` and every
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m function is called through a `dlsym`-resolved symbol.
